// - i_webhookMode tooltip updated to explain that v3.x requires TWO
//   separate TV alerts regardless of this dropdown setting:
//   one "Order fills only" alert to Ghost (execution) and one
//   "alert() function calls only" alert to GAS (logging). The dropdown
//   only controls which payload FORMAT fires from alert() calls —
//   it does not affect the strategy.order.alert_message path (Ghost).
// - isSheetsWebhook now also true when webhookMode = "Ghost Webhook"
//   so that alert() logging payloads fire in Ghost mode too. Previously
//   a new user on default settings had Ghost execution but silent GAS
//   logging — that is now fixed: both paths always active unless
