// RELEASE NOTES v3.1.12 — Session Loss Policy (Jul 2026, punchlist #6)
// - "Flip" policy: after i_lossStreakN (default 2) consecutive
//   same-direction LOSING trades within one session, NEW entries in that
//   direction are blocked until the next session (17:00 CT reset). The
//   opposite direction stays live. Blocked signals do not alert or log.
// - Per-preset defaults: MNQ ON (70/30 validated: test PF 1.128 -> 1.182,
//   +$894 OOS, DD -7%), M2K ON + MES ON (risk insurance, ~free),
//   MGC OFF (negative in test), SIL OFF (untested).
// - Master kill switch: "Enable Session Loss Policy" input.
// Gating is SAME-BAR via strategy.closedtrades (intrabar stop-outs gate this bar close signal).
// - Backtest basis: engine v2.3, Jul 5 2026 session, 70/30 protocol.
