// RELEASE NOTES v3.1.9 — Code review fixes (Jul 2026)
// - REGIME HEATMAP FIX: ta.ema moved inside request.security —
//   heatmap rows now compute true per-timeframe EMA-11 instead of
//   chart-resolution-sampled approximations. regime_score values
//   logged to AlertLog are now accurate across all 6 timeframes.
//   NOTE: port this fix to indicator line as v4.1.7 (shared code).
// - HOLIDAY-PROOF EOD BACKSTOP: session.islastbar_regular gate
//   guarantees flat book at every session close, including early-close
//   holidays (Jul 3, Thanksgiving Fri, Xmas Eve) where the fixed
//   15:50-17:00 CDT window never fires. Root cause of the Jul 2026
//   stuck MES position. Fires same webhook payloads as primary EOD.
// - FX GATE EFFICIENCY: fx_getStr now uses a single request.security
//   call per pair with local series offset — 20 calls reduced to 10.
//   Identical math. Total security budget now 16/40 (was 26/40).
// - DEAD CODE ANNOTATED (no behavior change): C3 WT OB/OS cross terms
