// RELEASE NOTES v3.0.4 — M2K optimized (conf=9,rsiOS=33,sl1=2.0,tp1=1.5); MNQ synced from v4.0.2 (swingLen=7,DOW Sun/Mon/Tue/Wed)
// - DOW display rebuilt from 2 rows to 6 rows (one per day).
