// ============================================================
// RELEASE NOTES v3.0.2 — DOW status rows in info panel
// - NEW: Two DOW display rows added to the info panel (rows 17-18), using the
//   four previously empty rows below Div Strat.
//   Row 17: "DOW" label | Sun  Mon  Tue  (space-separated, colored per state)
//   Row 18: blank label | Wed  Thu  Fri
//   Color coding:
//     Yellow  = today (current bar's day)
//     Green   = day is active (trades allowed)
//     Red     = day is blocked
//     Gray    = all days (when i_useDOW master switch is OFF — DOW filter inactive)
//   Label cell shows "DOW OFF" in gray when master switch is off.
//   Colors read from resolved p_dow_* values, so they correctly reflect whichever
