// RELEASE NOTES v2.0 — Forex Strength Gate
// - Embedded 5-currency strength meter (EUR/USD/GBP/JPY/AUD)
//   directly into MITS — no separate indicator needed
// - Calculates net % strength across all 10 pairs per currency
//   using configurable lookback (default 288 bars = ~1 trading day)
// - Gate logic per preset:
//     Long  allowed: fx_base_str - fx_quote_str >= i_fxMinDiv
//     Short allowed: fx_base_str - fx_quote_str <= -i_fxMinDiv
//     XAUUSD: uses -usd_strength as base (gold = inverse dollar)
//     Futures: gate always passes (fxGate=N/A)
// - Three new inputs in ⚡ Preset group:
//     🌐 Use Forex Strength Gate (toggle)
//     🌐 FX Min Divergence % (threshold, default 0.05%)
//     🌐 FX Strength Lookback bars (default 288, range 48-576)
// - FX Gate row added to info panel: N/A / OFF / LONG-OK /
//   SHORT-OK / BLOCKED with color coding
// - AlertLog payload adds 4 new fields:
//     fx_base_str, fx_quote_str, fx_divergence, fx_gate
// - GAS v6.8 required: AlertLog cols S-V for FX fields
// - No changes to any futures preset or entry/exit logic
