// === SESSION LOSS POLICY FLAGS (v3.1.12) — punchlist #6 ===
// "Flip" policy: after N consecutive same-direction losing trades in one
// session, block NEW entries in that direction until the next session; the
// opposite direction stays live. 70/30 validated on MNQ (test PF 1.128 ->
// 1.182, +$894 OOS); M2K/MES harmless risk insurance; MGC negative -> off.
