// ⚠️ OVERRIDE WARNING — READ BEFORE ENABLING ────────────────────────────
// Checking this box replaces EVERY parameter with the OVR values below.
// It is NOT a selective override — ALL params flip at once.
// For manual testing: pre-load ALL OVR inputs to match your active preset,
// then change only the parameter you want to test.
// For Python optimizer use: all values are set programmatically — safe.
// Toggle OFF for live trading — preset values take over automatically.
i_useOverrides = input.bool(false, 'Enable Optimizer/Micro Tuning (DEVELOPER TOOLS)', group = '🔧 Developer Tuning', tooltip = '⚠️ WARNING — FULL OVERRIDE: Checking this box replaces ALL preset parameters with the OVR values below — every single one, not just the ones you changed. If you only want to test one parameter, you must first manually set ALL OVR inputs to match your active preset\'s values, then change the one you want to test. Leaving any OVR input at its default while checking this box means you are running an unintended parameter combination. Used by the Python optimizer which sets all values programmatically. For manual micro-tuning: pre-load all OVR inputs to match your preset before enabling.')
i_ovr_conf = input.int(8, 'OVR Confluences', minval = 7, maxval = 9, group = '🔧 Developer Tuning')
i_ovr_rsiLen = input.int(14, 'OVR RSI Length', minval = 2, group = '🔧 Developer Tuning')
i_ovr_rsiOS = input.int(38, 'OVR RSI Oversold', minval = 10, maxval = 50, group = '🔧 Developer Tuning')
